'''Slowking''' (Japanese: '''ヤドキング''' ''Yadoking'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

