==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Slowking|H22}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*'''Litter''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Dark Slowking|9}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

